From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:59:54 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: the scout and the champion stand in the south strip of
 the hall

They stood beside the door, next to the old man. The scout now stands at
(160, 268) facing east and the champion at (272, 268) facing west, above the
pits' edges, clear of the door, the counters' fronts, the circle, the spawn
lane (216, 288), the wing entrances and the cases. Both placement tables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 games/tbs/src/scene/battle_arena.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

